## `fundere`: el embed es el primer campo del `struct` y el acceso explícito
## (`h.position3D.x`) es un campo normal. El nombre implícito del embed sale
## del tipo con la primera letra en minúscula (`Position3D` → `position3D`).
import std.spark

rune Position3D:
    x as float
    y as float
    z as float

rune Host fundere Position3D:
    health as int

weave main into int:
    var h as Host is with position3D is (with x is 1.5, y is 2.5, z is 3.5), health is 7
    calling spark.println with "{h.position3D.x},{h.position3D.y},{h.position3D.z},{h.health}"
    return 0
